## Direct MCP (do not proxy through lazy-tool)

| Server | When to use directly |
|--------|---------------------|
| **stash** (global) | `remember`, `recall`, goals, hypotheses, episodic memory |
| **prod-mcp** | Only if lazy-tool search fails or user needs a prod-only tool not in catalog |
| **exa** / **fetch** | Prefer lazy-tool first; direct servers are fallback |
| **brave-search** / **playwright** (global) | Web search / browser when lazy-tool has no match |

